# Redeeming Rocks (crystalWar 4), the quest's own var at the completion (missions as the main flow's): accepted,
# RedeemingRocksProg 0, RedeemingDay 1 (not today) and Quest[7][4]Prog 1 (GMs). Kocco Ehllek: 111; finished:
# npcUtil.completeQuest (Kocco's Earring, RedeemingDay 0, completed). npcUtil.completeQuest does no cleanup:
# Quest[7][4]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
lists WindurstWatersS/Kocco_Ehllek/onTrigger WindurstWatersS/onEventFinish/111
char zone=WindurstWatersS pos=-39.965,-1.125,-163.018 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
quest CrystalWar.RedeemingRocks accepted
charvar RedeemingDay 1
charvar Quest[7][4]Prog 1               # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger Kocco_Ehllek                    # RedeemingDay not today: 111
finish                                  # Kocco's Earring; RedeemingDay 0; completed, Prog kept
